  "question": {
    "text": "The electric field in an electromagnetic wave is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>NC</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Find the intensity of the wave if it is propagating along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis in the free space. (Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#1013;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>65</mn><msup><mi>Wm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
